rhaps as a comparison, but we can still keep our provisional recommendation as C, but note we need to evaluate B. That satisfies coverage. So we will keep vote for C, but bring up B's strengths and concerns, and suggest we need to compare.\n\nThus PUBLIC_MESSAGE: I agree with C, but we haven't fully examined B. Provide evidence: B is very conscientious (reliability), handles stress well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical competence), excellent computer skills (cognitive). Concerns: grumpy, uncooperative (crew cooperation), weak memory for numbers (attention). Implication: B could be a strong alternative, we need to discuss further before final. Vote remains C.\n\nNow METADATA_JSON: {\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
